IMPORT `ito-s40c-academic-degree`
IMPORT `ito-s40d-professional-studies`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance ss 40E and 40F — prevention of double credit. Row IL-27. Source lines 1683-1688.
--
-- s 40E: one who meets the conditions of both s 40C and s 40D elects whether the points of s 40C (a point, or half a point) or the point
-- of s 40D are brought into his tax computation. s 40F is repealed ("פקע", line 1686-1687): inert.
--
-- THE ELECTION is an input, for the computation of the tax year ("בחישוב המס שלו"): the section says nothing of keeping to the same
-- election in a later year, so each tax year's computation carries its own election and no consistency across years is enforced
-- (assumed, not ruled; NOTES.md A5). One who meets both and states no election is refused by name; one who meets only one has
-- that one, and nothing to elect.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Sections 40E and 40F — prevention of double credit`

-- src:1683 | סעיף 40ה – מניעת כפל [תיקון: תשס״ה־9, תשס״ז־5, תשע״ז־6]
-- src:1684 | יחיד שמתקיימים בו התנאים הקבועים בסעיף 40ג ובסעיף 40ד, יהיה זכאי לבחור אם יובאו בחשבון בחישוב המס שלו נקודת זיכוי אחת או מחצית נקודת זיכוי, לפי הענין, לפי סעיף 40ג או נקודת זיכוי לפי סעיף 40ד.
-- src:1686 | סעיף 40ו [תיקון: תשס״ה־9]
-- src:1687 | [note: (פקע).]

@ref ITO s 40E, line 1684
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 40E gives one who meets both section 40C and section 40D a choice, and he has not made it` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 40E gives one who meets both section 40C and section 40D a choice, and he has not made it"

@export The credit points under Income Tax Ordinance ss 40C, 40D and 40E for a tax year from 2024: where the individual meets the conditions of both, the points of the one he elects (s 40E); declines where he has not made the election
@ref ITO s 40E, line 1684
GIVEN `the studies` IS A LIST OF `An individual's academic studies, for section 40C`
      `the vocational studies` IS AN `An individual's vocational studies, for section 40D`
      `the choice` IS A MAYBE `The choice under section 40E`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the credit points under sections 40C, 40D and 40E for` `the studies` `and` `the vocational studies` `, the choice being` `the choice` MEANS
    `for tax year` (`the vocational studies`'s `tax year`) `, row IL-27 answers` `the answer`
    WHERE
        `meets 40C` MEANS elem TRUE (map (GIVEN s YIELD `s 40C — the conditions of the credit are met by` s) `the studies`)
        `meets 40D` MEANS `s 40D — the conditions of the credit are met by` `the vocational studies`
        `the answer` MEANS
            BRANCH
                IF   `meets 40C` AND `meets 40D`
                THEN CONSIDER `the choice`
                     WHEN NOTHING THEN
                         IF   `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` `the studies` EQUALS `the credit points under section 40D for` `the vocational studies`
                         THEN `the credit points under section 40D for` `the vocational studies`
                         ELSE `section 40E gives one who meets both section 40C and section 40D a choice, and he has not made it`
                     WHEN JUST c THEN
                         CONSIDER c
                         WHEN `the points of section 40C` THEN `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` `the studies`
                         WHEN `the point of section 40D`  THEN `the credit points under section 40D for` `the vocational studies`
                IF   `meets 40C` THEN `the credit points under section 40C for all of the individual's studies` `the studies`
                IF   `meets 40D` THEN `the credit points under section 40D for` `the vocational studies`
                OTHERWISE 0
